OL,3,GNEWSACouncil to launch review to
OL,4,Aimprove boys' prospects
OL,5,
OL,6,FBradford Council is set to bring in
OL,7,Fmeasures to tackle underachievement
OL,8,Famong white working-class children,
OL,9,Fparticularly boys, amid concerns over
OL,10,Fpoor GCSE results, school attendance
OL,11,Fand future prospects.
OL,13,FThe authority voted to carry out a
OL,14,Fdistrict-wide review, working with
OL,15,Fschools, employers and community groups
OL,16,Fto improve mentoring and
OL,17,Fapprenticeships.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,383,380,200,160,0,100
