OL,3,GNEWSACouncil to launch review to
OL,4,Aimprove boys' prospects
OL,5,
OL,6,FSally Birch, Executive Member for
OL,7,FChildren's Services, proposed a motion
OL,8,Furging a focus on the "significant"
OL,9,Fdisadvantages faced by young people, in
OL,10,Fparticular in white working-class
OL,11,Fcommunities.
OL,13,FShe said: "Bradford has known for years
OL,14,Fthat disadvantaged white boys are
OL,15,Fvulnerable to underachievement. We have
OL,16,Fthe national and local evidence."
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
